{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:30 2026-10-09 HKT</p>\n\n<p>38歲的歌手譚嘉儀（Kayee）今年8月宣布獲圈外男友求婚後，火速完成過「過大禮」儀式，以及到意大利威尼斯拍攝浪漫婚紗照。今日（9日）譚嘉儀完成人生大事，於早上在社交平台分享結婚大日子的照片，宣布正式做人妻。</p>\n<h2>譚嘉儀穿裙褂金光閃閃</h2>\n<p>譚嘉儀與圈外未婚夫近日到印尼峇里島的豪華度假村舉行婚禮，穿上傳統金光閃閃的裙褂，整套裙褂以金線與銀線細密繡上龍鳳及祥雲圖案，在峇里島的陽光下折射出耀眼的金銀光芒。雖然譚嘉儀身材嬌小，但身上的裙褂，在保留中式傳統的體面，又充滿現代時尚感，顯得個人身形修長。</p>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀穿上婚紗，今日（9日）在印尼舉行婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cb6737000117f29c071a3c170e29fe4/2026-10/TAM.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀與老公同樣挑選全白婚紗禮服行禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db0edeb665009b3c07d55a81597a5394/2026-10/TAM_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀到印尼峇里島舉行婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c50d918bfbd8376e26eb7900fa06d8c2/2026-10/Kayee_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀的8大港姐姊妹團。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/884e0de43baf6c14ebe631960fc6acde/2026-10/Kayee_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀的「星級姊妹團」穿上湖水藍色長裙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6016bc300bc6306222347e6d371c9465/2026-10/Kayee_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀的姊妹團包括林鈺洧、陳庭欣、黃嘉雯、鄧伊婷、鄧佩儀、陳丹儀、梁敏巧及王海榛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9515f6cdcf741d71ac5eae41d6c06caf/2026-10/Kayee_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀今日成為人妻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f0ae2c5f278aa9b40faf0eea7c78d6f/2026-10/Kayee_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀今日（9日）出嫁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b082c0b9ab60112e1b5870ae1aa5fd66/2026-10/Kayee_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀換上裙褂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78b51715bf398d8e90e5361e36785e47/2026-10/Kayee_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀由於在海外舉行婚禮，未見配戴金器。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5824be29eb00af3728633c5bd1218338/2026-10/Kayee_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧伊婷與新娘子譚嘉儀合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ffbfad073e767a9cf210820bf360e31/2026-10/Kayee_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀的婚禮花上不少心思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e10e9acf0948038c8259bf41b7806ce7/2026-10/Kayee_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀舉行婚禮前拍片好忙碌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b13d408d5008e488d46be7dc3c039bd8/2026-10/Kayee_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀與8位好姊妹拍片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff9c2b2183e520ad43d772a5c1025611/2026-10/Kayee_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀與眾姊妹大晒美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6bb84474f5ea25406bb08be09b032ae/2026-10/Kayee_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀與姊妹團坐在床上拍片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aee49249bc24a405bb83b4f69d2923a0/2026-10/Kayee_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀與姊妹團在床上擺甫士，非常吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc45834fe851a12adc0df3b8048ca482/2026-10/Kayee_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀拍片留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1656c100eec03efd3564042685b0d733/2026-10/Kayee_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀成為最美新娘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c2959f725a2c72c83add8b26d9ded4f/2026-10/Kayee_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"王海榛是譚嘉儀姊妹團之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98a317357527fc3766b933becbb8b4a7/2026-10/DADA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳庭欣是譚嘉儀的姊妹團之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc29dd7373ebcbd67cc22fbec7a37836/2026-10/Kayee_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳庭欣日前已到印尼峇里。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/084d75de9757964064d56ee4a0f36c53/2026-10/Kayee_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳庭欣參加譚嘉儀婚禮好似去度假。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80c0b1f1af80303ee186543001b1aaf3/2026-10/Kayee_23_.jpg\"/>\n<p>譚嘉儀邀請不少好友到海外兇席其婚禮，當中的「星級姊妹團」，次特意邀請了8位港姐級兼女神級閨蜜組成強大後盾，成員包括林鈺洧、陳庭欣、黃嘉雯、鄧伊婷、鄧佩儀、陳丹儀、梁敏巧及王海榛。</p>\n<h2>譚嘉儀出嫁前打扮火辣</h2>\n<p>譚嘉儀一行8位姊妹換上統一設計的湖水藍色長裙，手挽手出席譚嘉儀的婚禮，當中又見到眾人裝身前，穿上粉紅色絲質睡衣，與穿上紅色的新娘子譚嘉儀，一同大晒美腿在床上擺甫士，非常吸睛。</p>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀分享在意大利威尼斯拍攝的奢華浪漫婚紗照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8b0ce5a504194f1593af322b5a655d7/2026-10/KAYEE_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀未婚夫深情告白。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f171d886533e202f35dd6651a58bbb7/2026-10/KAYEE_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀說：「期待我們共同開啟人生的新篇章。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be687eb50a956be072f83c0d285430e7/2026-10/KAYEE_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀這次拍攝中展示了至少三套不同風格的婚紗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59f20565e921b77f3855f213c2ac01e8/2026-10/KAYEE_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀的每一套婚紗都突顯了她的「黃蜂腰」與及飽滿的上圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c06308f8123c6bca6ad7b5e16deee051/2026-10/KAYEE_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀散發著高貴、性感與浪漫的氣息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f210ba45b46c52a961ac8833fa00dc94/2026-10/KAYEE_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀釋出一系列唯美感十足的婚紗照並分享待嫁心情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/086c0e577431df625161ddb6679421cb/2026-10/KAYEE_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀視覺效果極具震撼力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07f63753196f488cad67ab4e95f1fda7/2026-10/KAYEE_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀的未婚夫大玩神秘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0932de6ba94884c1a8e8783c9f184fb9/2026-10/KAYEE_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀成功將優雅、夢幻與極致性感完美融合。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8706a40d7d2e7d6d3b7c8741c64d70e/2026-10/KAYEE_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀對未婚夫可謂做足保護，至今仍未見到她貼上未婚夫的正面樣\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/665aea98d39308a71a4bffe3e5edd561/2026-10/KAYEE_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀今次晒出二人在意大利的婚紗相，亦只見到未婚夫的側面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53b5ba7c113c25ac16fe814345017a21/2026-10/KAYEE_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀過大禮的排場驚人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca3d2f27fb7cf2a1d0de524d7f0c66f5/2026-09/2_2_112.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩位港姐冠軍黃嘉雯、林鈺洧為譚嘉儀組成「最美姊妹團」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1384bb214224f570427af24739400ddf/2026-09/3_0_71.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"過大禮的禮品樣樣講究好意頭，寓意「百年好合」、「金玉滿堂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e68380cedd5ca061b82cef34947d9e3d/2026-09/5_0_59.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"家中愛貓也來見證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42496f9e950ffc8e4b2a9c453d103fdc/2026-09/6_2_43.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"份量十足的龍鳳鈪與三層金豬牌，排場十足，盡顯氣派。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cce74f5151c1b875fe05a8232a303908/2026-09/7_2_31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀與未婚夫在「囍」字前甜蜜親吻，羨煞旁人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ebc9f8b86b29f438f60520e11f5ee50/2026-09/8_2_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一對準新人抱著愛貓拍攝溫馨「全家福」，場面搞笑又有愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a31906d52b3ee658f80dc14428cae778/2026-09/9_2_28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"待嫁新娘譚嘉儀在堆積如山的禮品前，做出心形手勢，幸福滿瀉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fc471a757a734218d3676f8276d286f/2026-09/10_1_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀在今年8月的38歲生日宣布喜訊，獲男友單膝下跪送上巨鑽戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e6e8597ae03b91d2c580a16e9a49bad/2026-08/1_4_44.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀未婚夫高大威猛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f43c4d379821a25a8636f5e94c22b43/2026-08/2_2_50.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀依偎未婚夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b153dd15b6025aff0d07da1f8734cc25/2026-08/3_0_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚嘉儀和未婚夫極甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b506b5292c737dfab1b6ad1f057d9b02/2026-08/4_10_16.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T15:38:58.061195+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":458,"images":47,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}